#4: FIND : to find a word or letter.. jaha mila (first occurence) uska 1st index ajayega..

print ( STRING.find( "c")) #gives the index of first C it sees in our string
#if aesa find kia jo exist hi nhi krta, to (-1) return hoga..as it does'nt exist in general until slicing


#5: COUNT : counts the number of occurences of a substring..

print(STRING.count(" a")) # should give 2
print(STRING.count("am"))

